    "decisionSummary": "Selected the 2026-08-22 dev-publish DomainTemplate v0.5.89/v111 cut. It moves this app to melusina-msb-protocol minor 14, which every other MSB participant in the estate was already built against: paype.cc 0.3.191, CCA.SH Configurator 0.0.82 and NamedCoin Admin all pin v0.0.0-20260809143748-456e1ca0143f, and this app alone still pinned minor 12. capability/validate.go compares minors for EXACT equality, so the skew refused every participant enrolment with 'domain-participant provisioning seed protocolVersion is invalid' and blocked portal enrolment, StationFactory provisioning of the identity-verification station, and the two-user NamedCoin account-opening ceremony. Protocol 1.14 adds execution provider profiles; no production code in this app authors them (the only production reference validates a producer-supplied description, and dossier/deletion claims are copied wholesale via capnp CopyFrom), so the change is confined to test fixtures that build those structures, each profile bound to its signed root. main is the reviewed stable ancestor of this cut.",
    "internalControls": {
        "status": "passed",
        "checks": [
            "fresh single-branch clone at the selected source commit with submodules initialised; git status --untracked-files=all empty",
            "go build ./... clean at protocol minor 14",
            "go test ./... green - the full pkg/template suite passes",
            "regression baseline recorded before the change: the bump alone failed 22 tests, 20 on one cause",
            "each execution provider profile bound to its signed root and verified by the protocol's own validators rather than by assertion",
            "profile issuer identity/licence READ FROM the built descriptor, not hardcoded - the fixtures derive from two different parent scopes and a hardcoded value fails as 'differs from its signed root'",
            "version cohort advanced together: Makefile PEARL_RELEASE_VERSION, metadata.json, sandstorm-pkgdef.capnp, release_identity.json, pkg/template/version.go, changelog head",
            "gofmt clean"
        ]
    },
